
UAV packet-based communication to standard C++17 only, using Linux TCP sockets.
GCS client and UAV simulator can communicate using the same 16-byte binary packets.

---------------------------------------------
Compile and run

g++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -pedantic uav_server.cpp -o uav_server
g++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -pedantic gcs_client.cpp -o gcs_client


./uav_server
./gcs_client
-------------------------------------------